    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in fast-paced gunfights in this stylish arcade with a top view! Hordes of enemies, colorful locations, four unique heroes with their own skills and exciting action are waiting for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of four heroes, each with their own unique abilities and play style, and challenge your enemies in a variety of colorful and dangerous arenas. Level up, upgrade and unlock new abilities to become a true killing machine. A vivid visual style, intense gameplay and endless drive await you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 4 unique characters </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Stylized graphics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of enemies and exciting battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Character progression and development</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fast, intense gameplay</p>",
